{"id":"n27338-1-9","stage":4,"title":"거스르다 · 违背","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27338-1-9-1","ko":"이 디자인은 유행을 거스르는 것 같은데요.","zh":"这个设计似乎有点违背潮流呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这","explanation":"이：冠形词“这”，修饰后面的 디자인（设计）。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"디자인은","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"디자인은","audio":"/audio/aea79d2e11eb7e85a33e.mp3"}},{"text":"유행을","meaning":"流行，时尚，时髦","explanation":"유행：流行，时尚，时髦；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"1","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행을","audio":"/audio/1dca591f57146445606f.mp3"}},{"text":"거스르는","meaning":"违背、逆着","explanation":"거스르다（违背、逆着）＋-는（修饰名词）；这里指设计不顺应流行趋势。","readings":[{"term":"거스르다","audio":"/audio/54fde6161b3b4066b107.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27338","senseId":"1","lemma":"거스르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거스르는","audio":"/audio/b3b6c53955c426673c29.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"情况、样子","explanation":"것 将前面的内容名词化；与 后面的 같다 连用表示推测。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데요.","meaning":"似乎、好像","explanation":"것 같다 表示根据情况作推测；-은데요 以礼貌语气陈述观察或保留余意。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데요","audio":"/audio/441937d13341d37ec5fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"这","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行，时尚，时髦","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"某个事物受人欢迎，在整个社会广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"54fde6161b3b4066","term":"거스르다","zh":"违背、逆着；本句指不符合潮流","audio":"/audio/54fde6161b3b4066b107.mp3","entryId":"27338","definition":"违背、逆着；本句指不符合潮流","pronunciation":["거스르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"似乎、好像（推测）","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"似乎、好像（推测）","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/423d3ab8121be4d5e046.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27338-1-9-2","ko":"하지만 모든 옷이 유행만을 따를 수는 없잖아요.","zh":"不过，不是所有的衣服都非得跟着潮流走啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하지만","meaning":"可是，但是","explanation":"하지만：可是，但是。","readings":[{"term":"하지만","audio":"/audio/e128a74754aad5c866ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72412","senseId":"1","lemma":"하지만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지만","audio":"/audio/e128a74754aad5c866ee.mp3"}},{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有。","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"유행만을","meaning":"流行，时尚，时髦","explanation":"유행：流行，时尚，时髦；만：表示“只、仅”；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"1","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행만을","audio":"/audio/d1373659581a1988358e.mp3"}},{"text":"따를","meaning":"遵从，遵循","explanation":"따르다：遵从，遵循；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"5","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따를","audio":"/audio/ac3d4c384ed9e5b30c17.mp3"}},{"text":"수는","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수는","audio":"/audio/0ae6625dd24dc5dcc565.mp3"}},{"text":"없잖아요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；잖아요：礼貌地提醒对方已知的事实：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없잖아요","audio":"/audio/d0b52c0a661b3266ceba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e128a74754aad5c8","term":"하지만","zh":"可是，但是","audio":"/audio/e128a74754aad5c866ee.mp3","entryId":"72412","definition":"用于连接两个内容相反的分句。","pronunciation":["하지만"]},{"id":"f069e2cf4e340740","term":"모든","zh":"全，所有","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3","entryId":"70813","definition":"一个不漏或一个不剩，全部的。","pronunciation":["모ː든"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audi